        <ArticleTitle>Spatial transcriptomics reveals tumor microenvironment heterogeneity in colorectal cancer</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>Spatial transcriptomics enables the mapping of gene expression within intact tissue sections. We applied spatial transcriptomics to 45 colorectal cancer specimens and identified distinct tumor microenvironment niches associated with patient outcomes.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
